{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The beloved Playdate platformer is now available on Steam!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Summit : Steps of Solace\u00a0</strong>is an exhilarating mountain climbing precision platformer, where you scale a relentless peak filled with brutal jumps, hazards, and shifting terrain. Master a range of tools to ascend higher, where every fall is a lesson and each hard-earned step gets you closer to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625100/extras/summit_gameplay_01.gif?t=1745389196\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Equipped with 2 pickaxes, scale the mountain to reach the top. Avoid physics based environmental hazards as you uncover the story behind our protagonist\u2019s unwavering tenacity to reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Average playthrough is about <strong>1-1.5 hours</strong> in length.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625100/extras/gameplay_grapple.gif?t=1745389196\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 70 Levels\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speed run mode\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Environmental Hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Collectibles\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will <strong>you</strong> reach the summit?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625100?t=1745389196","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625100/7f713482f3d579643084856770a357e7c881595d/page_bg_ra